 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's trade balance with China has worsened since 2010, moving from -19.8 million euros to -35.5 million euros in 2023.",
  "This represents a 79.4% increase in the trade deficit over this period.",
  "The trade balance was least negative in 2013 at -18.8 million euros, showing some improvement before worsening again.",
  "There is no seasonal or projection data available for this trade balance.",
  "The values are given in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect the interpretation of the trend."
